# sweep: --bare
# A reader with no pack and no outing: every tab says what is missing.
wait-for No field pack yet
expect logging works without one
expect Start an outing
clean
shot empty-today
tap Packs
wait-for No field pack yet
expect kobo fieldbook push
clean
shot empty-packs
tap Life list
wait-for No birds logged
expect Start an outing from Today
clean
shot empty-life
tap Search
wait-for Nothing to search yet
clean
shot empty-search
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Start an outing
tap Export
wait-for Nothing to export
expect kobo fieldbook export
clean
shot empty-export
# The tabs stay along the foot on every empty page, as they do on Packs and
# Life list, so the way on is in sight.
expect Today
expect Packs
tap Search
wait-for Nothing to search yet
expect Life list
expect Export
tap Today
wait-for Start an outing
